everyone.","modern":"கடற்கரைச் சோலையில் என் தோழியர் கூட்டம் என்னை விட்டு நீங்கியதால் நான் என் அழகை இழந்ததை விட, வாள் போன்ற விளிம்புகளைக் கொண்ட தடித்த மடல்களை உடைய தாழை மரங்கள் வேலியாக அமைந்த மெல்லிய கடற்கரை நாட்டின் தலைவனுடைய கொடுமை, பலரும் அறியும்படி பரவி வெளிப்பட்டால் அது எனக்கு மிகவும் துன்பம் தருவதாகும்.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her confidante, expressing her deep anxiety about her secret relationship with the hero. She explains that losing her physical beauty and health, which began when her childhood playmates left her, is painful enough. However, she states that it would be far more painful if the hero's neglect and cruelty became public gossip. The poem is set in the Neytal (maritime) landscape, where the screwpine with its sharp, sword-like leaves forms a protective fence. This image of the sharp screwpine represents the hostile, piercing gossip of the village that threatens to expose their secret love.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,1.63],[1.77,2.03],[2.03,2.57],[2.96,3.6],[3.8,4.2],[4.2,5.0],[5.0,5.3],[5.4,5.8],[5.8,6.2],[6.2,7.22],[7.22,7.46],[7.46,7.58],[7.58,8.3],[8.3,9.3],[9.3,9.7],[9.7,9.8],[9.8,10.7],[10.7,11.0],[11.12,11.38],[11.38,11.88]],"female":[[0.0,0.45],[0.6,0.72],[0.72,1.2],[1.2,2.1],[2.1,3.2],[3.2,3.47],[3.9,4.3],[4.35,4.7],[4.7,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.3,6.7],[6.7,7.1],[7.1,7.74],[7.74,8.7],[8.7,8.94],[8.94,9.3],[9.3,10.4],[10.4,11.0],[11.0,11.0],[11.0,12.4],[12.4,12.8],[12.8,13.4],[13.4,13.9]]},"sync":[[["கடல்","sea"],["அம்","beautiful"]],[["கானல்","seaside grove"]],[["கானல்","seaside grove"],["ஆயம்","playmates"]],[["மாய்ந்த","vanished"],["என்","my"]],[["நலம்","beauty"],["இழந்து","having lost"]],[["இழந்து","having lost"],["அதனினும்","more than that"]],[["நனி","much"],["இன்னாதே","is painful indeed"]],[["இன்னாதே","is painful indeed"]],[["வாள்","sword"],["போல்","like"]],[["வாய","having edges"]],[["கொழு","thick"],["மடல்","frond"]],[["தாழை","screwpine"]],[["மாலை","evening"],["வேல்"